      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹6.57 (vs ₹5.05 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹6.57 (up from ₹5.05 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹9.48b (up 15% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹428.3m (up 30% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 4.5% (up from 4.0% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 13% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 10% growth forecast for the Auto Components industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 43% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 40% per year.",
